Third-party material
--------------------

sub/abides_fork/, sub/patches/ and parts of sub/Dockerfile
    Derived from the Agenthon 2026 Track 3 baseline
    (https://github.com/Agenthon-2026/track3-simulation-public), MIT License.
    These files keep that licence.

ABIDES (https://github.com/jpmorganchase/abides-jpmc-public), BSD 3-Clause License
    Not included. The submission image fetches it at build time at the commit the
    benchmark pins. The native engine in native/ reimplements its behaviour and
    contains no ABIDES source code.

NumPy (https://numpy.org), BSD 3-Clause License
    native/rng/np_random.hpp reimplements the algorithms of NumPy's legacy
    RandomState so that the same seeds give the same streams.

Benchmark scenarios, reference outputs, harness and toolkit
    Not included. scripts/fetch_upstream.sh clones them from the organizers'
    repositories, where their own licences apply (the toolkit is CC BY-NC 4.0).
